rue}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"இனம்","parts":[{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"flock"}],"gloss":"flock"},{"surface":"தீர்","parts":[{"text":"தீர்","lemma":"தீர்","gloss":"separated"}],"gloss":"separated"},{"surface":"பருந்தின்","parts":[{"text":"பருந்து","lemma":"பருந்து","gloss":"kite"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the kite"},{"surface":"புலம்புகொள்","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"loneliness"},{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"lonely"},{"surface":"தெள்","parts":[{"text":"தெள்","lemma":"தெள்","gloss":"clear"}],"gloss":"clear"},{"surface":"விளி","parts":[{"text":"விளி","lemma":"விளி","gloss":"cry"}],"gloss":"cry"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சுரம்","parts":[{"text":"சுரம்","lemma":"சுரம்","gloss":"desert"}],"gloss":"desert"},{"surface":"செல்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"go"}],"gloss":"going"},{"surface":"மாக்கட்கு","parts":[{"text":"மாக்கள்","lemma":"மாக்கள்","gloss":"people"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the people"},{"surface":"உயவுத்துணை","parts":[{"text":"உயவு","lemma":"உயவு","gloss":"distress"},{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"companion"}],"gloss":"companion in distress"},{"surface":"ஆகும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"will"}],"gloss":"will be"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கல்","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"rock"}],"gloss":"rocky"},{"surface":"வரை","parts":[{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"அயலது","parts":[{"text":"அயல்","lemma":"அயல்","gloss":"neighborhood"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"adjacent"},{"surface":"தொல்","parts":[{"text":"தொல்","lemma":"தொல்","gloss":"ancient"}],"gloss":"ancient"},{"surface":"வழங்கு","parts":[{"text":"வழங்கு","lemma":"வழங்கு","gloss":"frequent"}],"gloss":"frequented"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"narrow"},{"surface":"நெறி","parts":[{"text":"நெறி","lemma":"நெறி","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"path"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"அடி","parts":[{"text":"அடி","lemma":"அடி","gloss":"feet"}],"gloss":"feet"},{"surface":"பொறிப்ப","parts":[{"text":"பொறி","lemma":"பொறி","gloss":"imprint"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to imprint"},{"surface":"தாஅய்","parts":[{"text":"தாஅய்","lemma":"தாவு","gloss":"cross"}],"gloss":"having crossed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"சென்று","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitival suffix"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"கேட்டனம்","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டனம்","lemma":"கேட்டனம்","gloss":"we heard"}],"gloss":"we heard","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆர்வலர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்வலர்","lemma":"ஆர்வலர்","gloss":"loving friends"}],"gloss":"loving friends","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பலரே","parts":[{"text":"பலர்","lemma":"பலர்","gloss":"many"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"many indeed"}]}],"literal":"If we speak, if he goes, journey difficult will become, thinking / on the desert road's ōmai tree's beautiful forked branch sat / flock-separated kite's lonely clear cry / desert-going people's distress companion will be / rocky mountain adjacent ancient frequented narrow path / beautiful feet to imprint, having crossed / that he went, we heard from loving friends many.","translation":"Thinking, 'If we speak to stop him, and yet he goes, his journey will become difficult,' we remained silent. Now, we have heard from many loving friends that he has gone, crossing the narrow, ancient, frequented path adjacent to the rocky mountains, imprinting his beautiful feet—where the clear, lonely cry of a kite separated from its flock, perched on a beautiful forked branch of an ōmai tree on the desert road, serves as a companion in distress to those who travel through the desert.","modern":"நாம் தடுத்தால் அவருடைய பயணம் கடினமாகிவிடும் என்று நினைத்து நாம் பேசாமல் இருந்தோம். பாலைவனப் பாதையில் உள்ள ஓமை மரத்தின் அழகான கிளையில் அமர்ந்திருக்கும், தன் கூட்டத்தைப் பிரிந்த பருந்தின் தனிமையான தெளிவான குரல், அந்தப் பாலைவனத்தில் செல்லும் மக்களுக்குத் துணையாக இருக்கும். கல் மலைக்கு அருகில் உள்ள, பழமையான, மக்கள் நடமாடும் அந்தச் சிறிய பாதையில், தன் அழகிய அடிகள் பதியுமாறு அவர் கடந்து சென்றார் என்று அன்புடைய பலர் சொல்லக் கேட்டோம்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend after her lover has departed for the desert to earn wealth. She explains that she did not try to stop him because she feared that her words of protest would make his journey emotionally difficult. Now, she has received news from travelers that he has successfully crossed the initial difficult paths. The poem belongs to the pālai (desert) landscape, where the image of the lonely kite, separated from its flock, calling out from the dry ōmai tree, mirrors the heroine's own loneliness. Yet, its cry is described as a 'companion in distress' to travelers, suggesting that even in the desolate desert, there is a strange comfort in shared suffering, hinting at her hope for his safe journey.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}